ction","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T17:57:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706687646","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:05:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4877120-1846651706678325","game_id":"steam-4877120","kind":"announcement","title":"New Gameplay Trailer and 17 Languages Added to Demo","summary":"Play the Demo and Leave a ReviewAll major fixes and updates to the demo have been published and we will be leaving the build alone for Steam Next Fest. If you run into any gameplay issues, please let us know. If you get chance to play the demo, please leave us a review on the demo page below to help us shape the final game design.Gameplay TrailerOur new gameplay trailer is live and show cases a combination of our improved first person anomaly hunting as well as the new third person narrative mod","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T16:01:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706678325","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:05:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4877120-1846651706675051","game_id":"steam-4877120","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update #3","summary":"Fixed-anomalies replayed too soon if you leave the anomaly room and come back-if using a game pad you couldnt select resolution and graphics settings","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T17:11:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706675051","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:05:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4877120-1846018067944303","game_id":"steam-4877120","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update #2","summary":"There were 3 anomalies that were broken -the alien rushing you-the room that opens up to the left animation didn't play for the man in there-the wheel chair anomaly","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T14:53:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067944303","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:05:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4877120-1846018067931000","game_id":"steam-4877120","kind":"announcement","title":"The AJ’s Anomaly Demo Is Live for Steam Next Fest!","summary":"The Demo is HereWe ran the AJ’s Anomaly playtest for about a month and received a lot of great feedback, and the game has changed significantly because of it. Thank you to everyone who played and shared their thoughts!The playtest is now closed, and the official demo is live, just in time for Steam Next Fest. This build brings a lot of new features we’re excited for you to try:Anomaly-driven narrative: the story now unfolds through the anomaly hunt itself, with clearer exposition along the wayIm","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T18:15:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067931000","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:05:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4877120-1845383656387115","game_id":"steam-4877120","kind":"update","title":"The new AJ's Anomaly third person patch is here!","summary":"The anomaly hunting gameplay mode has now been placed as a sub game mode within AJ's apartment. It's a therapy device assigned by Dr Cid from Alter Evo.A lot has changed with this build but most of it will be brand new to you. Our third person mode is very similar to the base gameplay in Alter Evo. Walk around rooms, interact with objects, listen to characters talk and hear their thoughts. There will also be some light puzzle mechanics.The new premise of the story is that we are at AJ's apartmen","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-02T17:06:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656387115","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:05:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4877120-1842846814449762","game_id":"steam-4877120","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest Updates from Player Feedback","summary":"Hey everyone, Leon from Technical Fiction here. We've had our playtest up for over a week now and just uploaded a patch based on user feedback.1. Players noted seeing textures load in when switching levels so we have added a fader adjustment to make the level transitions better.2. The main room was too dark so we did a lighting pass to brighten up the center of the room.3. The elevator UI looked janky so we updated it with some new hand drawn graphics and better fonts, and removed the fish-eye m","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-05T20:18:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814449762","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:05:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4877120-1842212951303530","game_id":"steam-4877120","kind":"announcement","title":"AJ's Anomaly Playtest is Here","summary":"Hey everyone, it's Leon from Technical Fiction.AJ's Anomaly is now available for playtesting. If you're reading this, you're lucky because you have access to the full game. What can you expect gameplay wise? AJ's Anomaly is very similar to Exit 8, you memorize a room and visit it over and over again looking for differences from the base setup. If you get 8 guesses correct in a row, you win the game. We want to know if the game is too hard, too easy, or if anything breaks. After you play, please ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-28T15:08:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951303530","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:05:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4877120":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:53:50Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:53:49Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4877120":"2026-10-26T14:53:50Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4877120":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:53:49Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:53:49Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:53:49Z"},"5304290":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:53:50Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:53:50Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:53:50Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4877120","app_id":4877120,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:04Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"1f66f79464502796e20ab7ff2cb0317e2ab86cd2584115977bdf9c9c2ca905a5","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"스토리 중심의 짧은 호러. 아파트에 갇힌 패션 디자이너 Amelia Jalisco가 되어 보세요. 상상 속 남자친구와 시간을 보내고, 이상 현상 치료 장치를 사용하며, 꿈같은 주변 환경을 탐험하세요.","publishers":[{"name":"Technical Fiction","creator_clan_account_id":43919189}],"developers":[{"name":"Technical Fiction","creator_clan_account_id":43919189}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1798704000,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_quarter"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Gameplay","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1792076518","trailer_category":0,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"4877120/1913063959/c6ab988dd88fbd